  "items": [
    {
      "info": {
        "name": "Clients",
        "type": "folder"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Create a unique identifier for a client",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://www.us-api.morningstar.com/token/v2/clients/generate-id",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "X-API-RequestId",
                "value": ""
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "A client ID is required when submitting a client’s questionnaire responses and when retrieving reports for a specific client. To create a client ID, pass an external identifier (e.g., a client’s email address) in the body of the request. The response will return a unique identifier for the client, which can then be used for future interactions."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Get Risk Tolerance questionnaire response history",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "https://www.us-api.morningstar.com/token/v2/clients/risks/questionnaires",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "X-API-RequestId",
                "value": ""
              }
            ],
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "clientId",
                "value": "",
                "type": "query",
                "description": "Unique identifier of a client"
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Retrieve a lsit of a client's previously submitted risk questionnaire responses. A unique identifier for each response is returned. Use the identifier to retrieve a specific response.\n"
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Submit a client's risk tolerance questionnaire responses",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://www.us-api.morningstar.com/token/v2/clients/risks/questionnaires",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "en-US"
              },
              {
                "name": "X-API-RequestId",
                "value": ""
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Submit a client’s risk tolerance questionnaire responses. A risk tolerance score and a unique identifier for the submitted responses is returnd. The identifier can be used to retrieve the client's responses at a later date."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Submit an agreed risk tolerance score",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "url": "https://www.us-api.morningstar.com/token/v1/clients/risks/questionnaires/:id/agreed-score",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "X-API-RequestId",
                "value": ""
              }
            ],
            "params": [
              {
                "name": "id",
                "value": "",
                "type": "path",
                "description": "Unique identifier of a response to a questionnaire"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Submit an agreed risk tolerance score for a specific set of risk tolerance questionnaire responses submitted by a client. **Important:** We recommend that financial professionals resolve any differences (or inconsistencies) in answers in the risk tolerance report with the client through discussion and adjusting the score where appropriate. This discussion and the agreed score should be documented and signed off by the client. The agreed score will be used for further analysis."
        },
        {
          "info": {
            "name": "Calculate suitability score",
            "type": "http"
          },
          "http": {
            "method": "POST",
            "url": "https://www.us-api.morningstar.com/token/v2/clients/solutions/calculate-suitability-score",
            "headers": [
              {
                "name": "X-API-RequestId",
                "value": ""
              },
              {
                "name": "Accept-Language",
                "value": "en-US"
              }
            ],
            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Using the Professional Judgment Matrix (PJM) framework, calculates the suitability score and score constraints of an investment/portfolio."
        },
