            "body": {
              "type": "json",
              "data": "{}"
            }
          },
          "docs": "Create a unique identifier for a client. You use this alphanumeric ID to identify your client within FinaMetrica. You must include the ID when submitting and retrieving a client's responses. The ID is generated based on the `externalId` (for example, client's email address) that is sent in the request. If your client already has an ID, you do not need to generate a new one. The ID will never expire."
        },
